{{ 'section-rich-text.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<div class="dr-policy-page page-width">
  <div class="dr-policy-hero">
    <div class="dr-policy-hero__badge">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 9h18v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V9z"/><path d="M3 9V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4"/><path d="M12 12v6"/><path d="M8 12v6"/><path d="M16 12v6"/></svg>
      Returns & Refunds
    </div>
    <h1 class="dr-policy-title">Return &amp; Refund Policy</h1>
    <p class="dr-policy-subtitle">Your satisfaction is our priority. We've made our returns process simple, fair, and hassle-free.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="dr-policy-body rte">

    <div class="dr-policy-highlight-grid">
      <div class="dr-policy-highlight-card">
        <span class="dr-highlight-icon">🗓️</span>
        <strong>7-Day Return Window</strong>
        <p>Initiate your return within 7 calendar days of receiving your order.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dr-policy-highlight-card">
        <span class="dr-highlight-icon">📦</span>
        <strong>Original Packaging</strong>
        <p>Products must be unopened, unused, and in their original sealed packaging.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dr-policy-highlight-card">
        <span class="dr-highlight-icon">✅</span>
        <strong>Easy Process</strong>
        <p>Contact us via WhatsApp or email to initiate your return — we'll guide you through every step.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>1. Our Commitment to You</h2>
    <p>At Dr. Romelia, we take immense pride in the quality and integrity of our clinically formulated skincare products. Every product is rigorously tested to meet the highest standards before it reaches you. However, we understand that sometimes things may not go as expected, and we are here to make it right.</p>

    <h2>2. Eligibility for Returns</h2>
    <p>To qualify for a return, the following conditions must be met:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>The return is initiated within <strong>7 calendar days</strong> of the delivery date.</li>
      <li>The product is <strong>unopened, unused, and in its original condition</strong>.</li>
      <li>The product is in its <strong>original, sealed packaging</strong> with all labels, seals, and protective covers intact.</li>
      <li>The product is <strong>not a sale item</strong> or part of a limited-time promotional bundle (unless found to be defective).</li>
      <li>Proof of purchase (order confirmation or delivery receipt) is provided.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="dr-policy-notice dr-policy-notice--warning">
      <strong>⚠ Please Note:</strong> Due to the personal nature of skincare and hygiene products, we are <strong>unable to accept returns on opened, used, or partially consumed products</strong>, except in cases where the product is found to be defective or damaged upon arrival.
    </div>

    <h2>3. Non-Returnable Items</h2>
    <p>The following items are not eligible for return or refund:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Products that have been opened, used, or had their seals broken.</li>
      <li>Gift sets, bundles, or promotional items (unless faulty).</li>
      <li>Products returned after the 7-day return window.</li>
      <li>Items purchased during final sale or clearance events.</li>
      <li>Products not purchased directly from <strong>drromelia.com</strong>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Damaged or Defective Products</h2>
    <p>If your product arrives <strong>damaged, defective, or incorrect</strong>, we sincerely apologise and will take full responsibility. In such cases:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Contact us within <strong>48 hours of delivery</strong> via WhatsApp or email.</li>
      <li>Share clear photographs of the product and packaging, clearly showing the damage or defect.</li>
      <li>Our team will review your case and arrange a <strong>replacement or full refund</strong> at no additional cost to you.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. How to Initiate a Return</h2>
    <p>To start a return, please follow these simple steps:</p>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Contact Us:</strong> Reach out to our customer support team via WhatsApp at <strong>+92 300 1234567</strong> or email us at <a href="mailto:info@drromelia.com">info@drromelia.com</a> with your order number and reason for return.</li>
      <li><strong>Receive Approval:</strong> Our team will review your request and confirm your return eligibility within <strong>1–2 business days</strong>.</li>
      <li><strong>Ship the Product:</strong> Once approved, securely repackage the item and send it to the return address provided by our team. Please retain your shipping receipt for reference.</li>
      <li><strong>Inspection &amp; Processing:</strong> Upon receiving the returned item, our quality team will inspect it within <strong>3–5 business days</strong>.</li>
      <li><strong>Refund or Exchange:</strong> If the return is approved, your refund or exchange will be processed as per the section below.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>6. Refund Method &amp; Timeline</h2>
    <p>Once your return has been inspected and approved:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD) Orders:</strong> Refunds for COD orders will be processed via bank transfer (EasyPaisa, JazzCash, or direct bank account). Please provide your payment details to our support team. Refunds are processed within <strong>5–7 business days</strong> of return approval.</li>
      <li><strong>Online Payment Orders:</strong> Refunds will be credited back to your original payment method within <strong>7–10 business days</strong>, depending on your bank or payment provider.</li>
      <li><strong>Exchange:</strong> If you prefer an exchange, we will dispatch the replacement product once the return has been received and inspected.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="dr-policy-notice dr-policy-notice--info">
      <strong>📌 Please Note:</strong> Original shipping charges are non-refundable unless the return is due to our error (wrong product, defective item, or damaged in transit).
    </div>

    <h2>7. Return Shipping Costs</h2>
    <p>For eligible returns due to a change of mind (product is unopened and unused), the customer is responsible for return shipping costs. However, if the return is due to a defective product, incorrect item, or damage caused in transit, Dr. Romelia will bear the full return shipping cost.</p>

    <h2>8. Policy Updates</h2>
    <p>Dr. Romelia reserves the right to update or modify this Return &amp; Refund Policy at any time. Changes will be effective immediately upon publication on this page. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.</p>
    <p>Last updated: <strong>August 2026</strong></p>

